# Local agent run artifacts (logs, PIDs, run receipts).
# Anchored with a leading slash so only the repo-root directory matches, and
# with a trailing slash so a *file* named .local-logs is not silently ignored.
# NOT `.local-logs/**`: that ignores the contents while leaving the directory
# walkable, and gitignore(5) notes a file cannot be re-included once a parent
# directory is excluded.
/.local-logs/
/.tmp/
